      "text": "| Per-view layout CSS | `ai/<machine>/System/Views/<view-folder>/styles/layout.css` | One view |"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/005-Enforcement/002-Themes_And_State/PAGE.md",
